Problem:
According to the sequence of \(\mathrm{AgF}\), \(\mathrm{AgCl}\), \(\mathrm{AgBr}\), \(\mathrm{AgI}\), which of the following statements correctly describes the changes in properties? 
(A) Color becomes darker; 
(B) Solubility becomes smaller; 
(C) Transition from ionic bond to covalent bond 
(D) Both (A), (B), and (C) are correct.
